name verbatlas-frame-info
# A frame on each row: its id (va:0001f, the key VerbAtlas points at the frame with, recorded nowhere), its name
# (TOLERATE, the frame's content, as the highway lists it), its definition, its prototypical BabelNet synset (a key
# of a WordNet synset, read as the ILI concept), that synset's definition, and a small definition.
match VA_frame_info.tsv
grammar table
comment V
columns ID name definition prototypical_synset definition_of_the_prototypical_synset small_definition
type ID vaframe
type prototypical_synset ili
claims
subject in ID
attest definition prototypical_synset definition_of_the_prototypical_synset small_definition
